  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ea107d3d0fbef947af73792cc9f28a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: MubertEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Today we bring you news about a recent Cubert Daycare incident.
  - A cubert named Mubert has been deemed as the strongest cubert among every cubert.
  - Some citizens are criticizing the result and saying that they didn't test their
    cuberts.
  - The first round of testing results in a clear victory, but they had hinted at
    a second test.
  - The time of the second test is unknown, but it doesn't seem like they will be
    running a second test anytime soon.
  - That is all for today's news. Thank you so much for watching, and make sure to
    buy your own Mubert today!
